related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-032\n- observed_method: Single 2025-26 playoff G1s, 4 games x 2 offenses; leverage-weighted gap between observed and recommended mix.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-008", "score": 0.143, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-008 | Study family SF-APPA-008: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- observed_research_question: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: The agent batch's findings (defensive adjustments, point costs, adaptation predicts series winners 9/10) are valid.\n- observed_result: 706 findings with n<5; list_h2h_games called 0 times; series winners LLM-inferred; MIA-BOS G7 score invented (BOS 100 vs graph 84); what_came_next skips a possession; point costs are LLM arithmetic.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Series winners never looked up (0/2073 calls); master '9/10' rule built from LLM inference on inference; low-n claims (e.g. 0.0 PPP on n=3).\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-009"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-001", "score": 0.131, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-001 | Study family SF-APPM-001: Play-type mix alignment vs actual PPP (matchup residual)\n- observed_research_question: Play-type mix alignment vs actual PPP (matchup residual)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Holdout games where a team's play-type mix is closer to the model's recommended mix score more efficiently.\n- observed_result: Raw gap aligned-deviated +5.18 ORtg; strength-controlled gap +3.27 ORtg (+0.0193 vs -0.0134 PPP residual). Model regret median +25.94 ORtg (non-negative by construction).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Strength-controlled gap +3.27 ORtg persists after team/opponent residualization.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=908 rows; no CI stated\n- auto_validation_status: same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPM-001: '908 holdout game-team rows (454 games), terciles of l1 distance actual'\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- observed_failure_type: D_positive\n- auto_confidence: high (0.95)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-013"}], "n_results": 4}

